# Aquacorde Town (and its rooms): the riverside town of the old bridge and the café on the waterfront, a bright
# clarinet tune in D over a plucked guitar and a light brushed step, the water going by under it, with a softer middle
# section in G before it comes round again. Original composition for this game (plan 23 · Z1).
